# The world model is regenerable: `run.py load` plus the prompts and responses
# in work/ reproduce it exactly. A binary that churns on every stage does not
# belong in the history.
data/founder_os.db
data/*.db-journal
work/cycle.json

# The prompts and responses in work/ ARE committed on purpose. They are the
# audit trail: every ranking in a report can be traced back to the exact text
# that produced it.
